{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d993488d204137ce5363d94f730b43fa798839b6fb61d566ea90dfcb05c7daeb", "ja": "（次の劇場定期公演の、センターが決まった。\nあとは、本人のやる気次第だな……）", "zh": "（下一次剧场定期公演的Center决定了。\n接下就看她本人意愿如何了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "5808286f3699e2a3a15b0b86b652791e42d5988f2d7f81a85931cd535630127c", "ja": "おっと！　ウワサをすれば、\n{$P$}ちゃんの登場だよ！", "zh": "喔！才刚提到，\n小{$P$}就登场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "874a3f725ea5ef139a92eb8e2416ac91c71cc457140892b36d64c624e99d521b", "ja": "さあ、茜ちゃんにセンターの座を与えたまえ！\n遠慮なく、さあさあ！", "zh": "来吧，赐予小茜Center的宝座吧！\n不用客气，尽管来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5d203865237999d6e9e258b403196cee6dbeffdfac7e193b8a8ccdaa92b9c7f9", "ja": "おっ？\n言いたい事がよくわかったな、茜。", "zh": "喔？\n茜，你怎么知道我要说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1004_p", "source_sha256": "f8135ba1963c63d28620acb412916ebfb5cbe537838d51ab35870d6b977c84b3", "ja": "次の公演のセンターは、茜にまかせようと思ってる。\n期待してるから、よろしくな！", "zh": "我想把下次公演的Center位置交给你负责。\n我很期待你的表现喔，麻烦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "476635d3f15dd29a2c26b47585b6c1370e9e5257f37b80262ef07497e6b2bee3", "ja": "え……えっ、えええええっ！？", "zh": "咦……咦、咦咦咦咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1006_023aka", "source_sha256": "2098b512604d1ef66df1a4ab168d11697e5a8829f48587fb4e65f4ed289a475c", "ja": "あ、茜ちゃんがセンター？\nホントにホントのホント！？　ウソじゃなくて！？", "zh": "小、小茜负责Center？\n千真万确吗！？不是开玩笑吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "3b795cc7f54f90ddc85a9fd5816d9042c49283816f38217becb1a025f595c486", "ja": "ハッ！　まさかこれは、巧妙に仕組まれたドッキリ……\nそうなの、{$P$}ちゃん！", "zh": "啊！莫非这是精心策画的整人……\n是这样吗？小{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1008_033sih", "source_sha256": "8c9461d9448483e3a9f53005b2c047d248cfc9d1ed4844fe14f27cb01b333d83", "ja": "茜さん。\n別に、ウソでもドッキリでもないと思いますよ。", "zh": "茜。\n我觉得制作人不是开玩笑，也没有整你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1009_p", "source_sha256": "0e9a3e2152d76988b9d2d6daa42ffc9f1b29833ffba789a56cf1da95ad6bbf6e", "ja": "ああ、志保の言うとおりだ。正真正銘、\n次は茜にセンターをやってもらうつもりだからな。", "zh": "是啊，志保说得没错。\n我是真的想请茜担任下次的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1010_023aka", "source_sha256": "d2bf008932f8f86982cac24faf49840de77162595f7281d33243cf993f47813a", "ja": "え、じゃあ夢？　だってタイミング良すぎでしょ！？\nしほりんとセンターの話してたら、はいセンターって！", "zh": "咦？所以这是梦吗？不然未免也太凑巧了吧！？\n小茜才刚跟志保保提起Center，Center就送上门来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1011_009rit", "source_sha256": "63a026a76c0a9f81c441760af53efda53e32eb319718283962037f47b25ffed7", "ja": "あら。せっかくのセンターなのに、\n茜は信じられないの？", "zh": "哎呀？终于有这个机会当Center，\n茜你居然难以相信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "055d292743ceae723f9ed5a4ae4804ab3f439478a994c27133459a2e3511becd", "ja": "だったら、夢かどうかわかるように……\n私が、ほっぺをつねって確かめてあげましょうか？", "zh": "既然如此，想知道是不是作梦……\n就让我来捏捏你的脸颊吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "044e00448617790104042113a09f8770fe00e84c7302265c064d36397369da28", "ja": "り、律子さん！　いやわかった、わかりました！\n夢じゃない！　夢じゃないから～っ！", "zh": "律、律子姊！不用了，小茜知道了、知道了！\n这不是梦！这不是梦啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1014_023aka", "source_sha256": "5f05f125c3cd3a76fe6cce7fda07852cfa3f0111a4feafc4cf8b6e77acb56ee0", "ja": "だから、茜ちゃんの熟れたリンゴのような、\n愛らしいほっぺをつねろうとするのはやめて～！", "zh": "所以，求求你不要捏\n小茜有如成熟苹果般的可爱脸颊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "af997cd64f0736c8d37c7dcb7582401640f44fb22d97133711b4197ae35693c4", "ja": "あらそう、わかってくれてよかったわ。\n……けど、ちょっと怯えすぎじゃないかしら？", "zh": "这样啊，你知道就好。\n……只是，你也不用这么害怕吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1016_p", "source_sha256": "5e070cdd8a0db9d8c38912649ee728fcd777559ef5b861c665c00f5f9ef4e1c5", "ja": "茜。俺は、茜が\n次の公演のセンターに相応しいと思ったんだ。", "zh": "茜，我认为你很适合担任下次公演的Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1017_p", "source_sha256": "34707d582dcfc6b280aff8cc894b9191e05403fd0ef7654369cce145e0d05933", "ja": "だから、もし不安なら相談してくれ。\nプロデューサーとして、解消できるよう努めるから。", "zh": "所以，要是你觉得不安，就来找我商量吧。\n身为制作人，我会努力替你消除不安的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "96cdef9a9a3a577bcc4810c4c0fc19521ef27800593bbdcf4078268d0a7c8a53", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん……。\nハッ！", "zh": "小{$P$}……\n啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1019_023aka", "source_sha256": "ea17d1ecd37af648ac07eb725bcf00c3d2ac2e83562fc25dd51fdef745f51b05", "ja": "や、やだな～不安なんてないない！\n茜ちゃんの実力なら、センターくらい余裕だもんね！", "zh": "讨、讨厌啦～小茜怎么会不安呢！？\n凭小茜的实力，区区Center游刃有余啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1020_023aka", "source_sha256": "3d37d9e50cc50d4e593713e4934369fe9b95d21beb40e5ef4ffd86ce940e7a5d", "ja": "だから{$P$}ちゃんだって、『次の\nセンターは、ぜひ茜ちゃんに！』って思ったんでしょ？", "zh": "小{$P$}也是因为这样，\n才会觉得『下次的Center一定要交给小茜！』对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b1f9e3f9c25b6c21fec0e9c3ebe37f1e9ec4d1075588bc2c31308b8db1850373", "ja": "いや、それはもちろんそうだけど。\nそういう事じゃなくて……。", "zh": "不，我当然认为茜很适任，\n但不是你想的那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "8486e2217b42b1fcdd0f07830c4759b5ac3085d3e86c7c7d1abcaae44f71f681", "ja": "茜？　センターっていうのは、\nそんなに簡単なものじゃないのよ。", "zh": "茜，\n担任Center并不是那么简单的事情喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1023_009rit", "source_sha256": "677ebc7435fb793dbe9d6c70cf2610a2e2e98022e847d3a7b1f5a9726da42905", "ja": "ただ真ん中で歌って目立てばいいってものじゃないの。\nみんなをまとめる責任だってあるし……。", "zh": "并不是只要站在中央位置唱歌、吸引目光就好。\n还需要负起责任带领大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "1d939aac379d216d77a911550804416ed8e4d6d9ceb55ff8bbc1149abe24516c", "ja": "も、もちろんだよ律子さん！\n茜ちゃんはセンターとしての責任を……責任……。", "zh": "那、那还用说吗？律子姊！\n小茜会负起Center的责任……责任……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1025_p", "source_sha256": "cedefec42c3cb7066a7468f845852c0047ff3c5674ed276168d9abc93ffbd3e5", "ja": "茜？", "zh": "茜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "09b98047ba9c3a75f2d742cf81a811529aa3ac0b69e3cbd1f3ee0327774f2dfa", "ja": "こ、こうしちゃいられない！　茜ちゃんの初センター、\nいろいろと準備しなくちゃ……！　失礼しまーす！！", "zh": "不、不能继续浪费时间了！小茜首次担任Center，\n有很多事情要准备……！告辞──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "f991d6e40c3830dd53525edf7d9ca55ab152040b33d42e9359e9fa5e1380f51d", "ja": "ちょっと、茜？　人の話を……もう、慌ただしいわね。\nそれにしても、本当に大丈夫なのかしら……。", "zh": "等一下，茜！听我说完……真是的，这么匆忙。\n不过，她真的没问题吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1028_p", "source_sha256": "a031a9d1d3d143ef13abe695a3eba6aa943859ab1107f94097e64ac711994d95", "ja": "うん。準備って言ったけど、まだ演出プランも\n決まってないのに、何を準備するつもりなんだろう。", "zh": "嗯，她说要做准备，但现在连演出计划都还没出来，\n到底要准备什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "bbe0be91efe2bab31c8cb54a09e5df68497584ff27cc532d4837c029a9d57f49", "ja": "茜さんにも、いろいろあるんじゃないですか。\n心の準備とか。", "zh": "茜要准备的东西应该还有很多吧？\n像是心理准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "87437b0dae5b4d7f2112333855ac00ae601084f3cf0ae1deefa62d1c07f8f339", "ja": "心の準備？\n……茜にも、そんな繊細なところがあったのね。", "zh": "心理准备？\n……原来茜也有这么敏感的一面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1031_p", "source_sha256": "b90e8a51f536de8f4c53ebe21513647ac58c546e750cd6d77977a4329e866d64", "ja": "志保。次の公演は、志保にも出てもらいたいと\n思っているんだけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "志保，我希望你也能参加下次公演，\n没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "83356588561a699085b4c8be04dd97a8437fd897a14b9ffea763d9b048e786e7", "ja": "はい、わかりました。", "zh": "好的，我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1033_p", "source_sha256": "efa5f2d0b4f6cf4ebf1f0ece956607e2d6655cede648c752a99d16cbbe238bae", "ja": "それと律子、悪いけど茜をサポートしてくれないか？\nできる範囲で構わないから……。", "zh": "还有律子，抱歉，可以麻烦你协助茜吗？\n在能力所及范围内就行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "d0859d4faeaf5fb1beef249ab8c1a5238a46904a410c46f3e006118a2838da10", "ja": "もちろん、手伝いますよ。任せてください！\n茜のことは、私がきっちり監督しますから。", "zh": "我当然会帮忙啊，包在我身上！\n我会好好指导茜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "3bed8c06698ee7b3076b9c5e7e295b0faed21eb44041b04128953612d6b6869a", "ja": "私も手伝います。茜さんには、いろいろ……。\nそれに、出るからには良い公演にしたいですし。", "zh": "我也会帮忙，毕竟以前受茜很多帮助……\n而且，既然要参加公演，就要拿出好的表现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1036_p", "source_sha256": "820add8d58be977eed291043963fa0025ae67b13c9c58f771d6e3978f0437b8d", "ja": "ああ。ふたりとも、よろしく頼む！", "zh": "好，那就麻烦两位了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "4cdf426c11016bcf36aa3d52bedda8105a2b628163da1e38d75650958d536a82", "ja": "はいっ。", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_026_1038_009rit", "source_sha256": "4cdf426c11016bcf36aa3d52bedda8105a2b628163da1e38d75650958d536a82", "ja": "はいっ。", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
